{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225470","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225470","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:5:1222547001:0":{"text":"Is everything ready, Hugin?","source_cn":"呼金，这样就可以了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE428F99B834322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222547002:0":{"text":"Yes, all my children are ready. They're eager to let loose on this Hypogean!","source_cn":"没错，这些年轻的孩子都做好准备了。他们跃跃欲试，随时等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0963AF51AC253768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222547003:0":{"text":"It's all up to Sinbad now. Contact him on the merlindabest.","source_cn":"该轮到辛巴达那小子干活了，用小梅给他发信号！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0DBC42740C986D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1222547003":{"text":"It's all up to Sinbad now. Contact him on the merlindabest.","source_cn":"该轮到辛巴达那小子干活了，用小梅给他发信号！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0DBC42740C986D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222547004:0":{"text":"We don't need to wait for his reply. Right now, he's probably as nervous as a lobster at a seafood buffet.","source_cn":"嚯嚯，不用等那小子回信，现在是他神经最紧绷的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0070